- [Krizhevsky, Sutskever and Hinton (2012), ImageNet Classification with Deep Convolutional Neural Networks](https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2012/file/c399862d3b9d6b76c8436e924a68c45b-Paper.pdf).
- [BVLC AlexNet deployment geometry](https://github.com/BVLC/caffe/blob/master/models/bvlc_alexnet/deploy.prototxt).
- [CIFAR-10 dataset and binary-file layout](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~kriz/cifar.html).
